# PBD / XPBD in Blender

Compact XPBD core (distance, bending, volume) for Geometry Nodes **PBD Solver**.

- Method: Macklin / Müller / Bender XPBD (MIG 2016) + Bender PBD survey.
- Not a git-subtree of https://github.com/InteractiveComputerGraphics/PositionBasedDynamics
  (that tree pulls Eigen, imgui, JSON scenes). This is a Box2D-style embeddable subset.
- License: MIT (see LICENSE)
